<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.7">
<l>pātaṅkaṇ mēlaṇipūt toḻakkūṭuṅkol pāvainallī</l>
<l>rōtane ṭuntaṭattuḷ ḷuyartāmarai ceṅkaḻunīr</l>
<l>mātarkaḷ vāṇmukamuṅ kaṇṇumēntun tiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>nātaṉiñ ñālamuṇṭa nampirāṉṟaṉṉai nāṭōṟumē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Is it possible to worship the decorative flowers on [his] feet, o you women good,</l>
<l>everyday our lord who ate this world, the master</l>
<l>of Tiruvallavāḻ, where women hold up bright faces and eyes</l>
<l>to the red lotus [and] purple water-lilies rising by the flooded large tank?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
